From 4bab6c5e8348dc37c97dd4a881e3359fc04d8348 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: issakakar <Issakakar@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 11:03:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] chore(editor): regenerate the api report and fix tsdoc in
 the new files

api-extractor needs the types a public signature mentions to be exported, so
FlatRTree, FlatRTreeStats, ShapeSpatialIndex and SpatialQuery are exported from
the package entry, all @internal. The report grows by 87 lines and loses
nothing.

Also escapes the angle brackets and braces api-extractor's tsdoc parser
objected to, and qualifies the bare {@link member} references.
